WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.527
Two thousand, one hundred and thirty-eight registered lobbying contacts.

00:00:04.477 --> 00:00:06.488
One organization.

00:00:06.488 --> 00:00:10.136
A direct documented pipeline — from lobbying... to law.

00:00:10.136 --> 00:00:16.909
The Centre for Israel and Jewish Affairs is one of the most active lobbying organizations in Canada's federal registry.

00:00:16.909 --> 00:00:23.295
Their contacts span the Prime Minister's Office, the Department of Justice, and key Parliamentary committee members.

00:00:23.295 --> 00:00:26.465
The documented sequence follows a clear pattern.

00:00:26.465 --> 00:00:29.624
First, IHRA definition adoption.

00:00:29.624 --> 00:00:32.136
Then, Criminal Code amendments.

00:00:32.136 --> 00:00:35.170
Then, Human Rights Act civil remedies.

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:37.352
Then, MAID expansion.

00:00:37.352 --> 00:00:39.818
Each stage building on the last.

00:00:39.818 --> 00:00:49.056
Every data point you see in this analysis comes directly from Canada's own Commissioner of Lobbying registry, Hansard committee records, and published Parliamentary testimony.

00:00:49.056 --> 00:00:51.431
These are not allegations.

00:00:51.431 --> 00:00:55.909
These are the government's own documented contacts — we just organized them.
